nds — is a justified environmental necessity, not a design change; it preserves real type-checking for later stories. Tracked follow-up: swap to real PI imports when the packages are installed (Epic 2 serving / Epic 4 packaging). (2) initLhc as a thin wrapper over createSdk: spec-anticipated by tech-arch A-4 and tech-design Open Question Q2 ('mechanical either way'); the rename rides the first LHC change batch. Impl-lead independently ran the story gate `pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify`: build, typecheck, lint, boundaries all OK; 6 test files / 19 tests pass; baseline 375 -> 381 (no regression).\",\"source\":\"impl-lead (Claude Code orchestrator) per ls-impl story-cycle ruling\"}]},\"runtimeIdentity\":{\"version\":\"0.4.0\",\"invocationSource\":\"unknown\",\"entryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbuild-impl.js\"},\"replayBoundary\":null,\"logHandoff\":{\"recommendedState\":\"NEEDS_RULING\",\"recommendedCurrentStory\":\"00-foundation\",\"recommendedCurrentPhase\":\"story-orchestrate\",\"continuationHandles\":{\"storyImplementor\":{\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"sessionId\":\"814546fe-4436-4e4f-8c69-071884ddc90c\",\"storyId\":\"00-foundation\"},\"storyVerifier\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019ec436-5dff-7ec1-a099-fca4b5b8d01c\",\"storyId\":\"00-foundation\"}},\"storyReceiptDraft\":{\"storyId\":\"00-foundation\",\"storyTitle\":\"Story 0: Extension Foundation\",\"implementorEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/003-implementor.json\"],\"verifierEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/005-verify.json\"],\"gateCommand\":\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\",\"gateResult\":\"pass\",\"dispositions\":[{\"id\":\"S0-001\",\"status\":\