 concurrent same-cwd session could be selected instead and defers precise reload lineage to Feature 2+. The test at packages/pi-lhc/test/lifecycle/thread-resolution.test.ts:335-370 proves only the single-thread-in-cwd case, not reconstruction from the prior resolved thread id.\"]},{\"id\":\"SV-002\",\"status\":\"unresolved\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/011-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/014-verify.json\",\"AC-1.7 requires --resume/-r to list cwd-scoped threads with title and creation time and resolve the operator's selection (story lines 59-61; tech design lines 231 and 251-253). The revised defaultSelectThread shows the list via ctx.ui.notify but then returns mostRecent.threadId at packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:157-176. The production test asserts notification plus most-recent behavior at packages/pi-lhc/test/lifecycle/thread-resolution.test.ts:255-290. The implementor artifact records this as a spec deviation because the available PI UI surface has notify but no interactive input.\"]}],\"baselineBeforeStory\":381,\"baselineAfterStory\":384,\"openRisks\":[\"Verification finding SV-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-002 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-002 remains unresolved.\"]},\"cumulativeBaseline\":{\"baselineBeforeCurrentStory\":381,\"expectedAfterCurrentStory\":384,\"latestActualTotal\":384},\"commitReadiness\":{\"state\":\"not-ready\",\"reason\":\"Caller ruling is still required before impl-lead commit.\"},\"openRisks\":[\"Verification finding SV-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-002 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-002 remains unresolved.\"]},\"cleanupHandoff\":{\"acceptedRiskItems\":[],\"deferredItems\":[{\"description\":\"Reload production path for no-flag/--resume uses cwd-most-recent registry selection, not the prior resolved thread id.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/011-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/014-verify.json\",\"Reload production path for no-flag/--resume uses cwd-most-recent registry selection, not the prior resolved thread id.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"Production --resume presents choices through notify but auto-selects most recent; there is no real operator selection in the production path.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/011-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/014-verify.json\",\"Production --resume presents choices through notify but auto-selects most recent; there is no real operator selection in the production path.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null}],\"cleanupRequired\":true},\"rulingRequest\":{\"id\":\"01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution-story-run-001-ruling-048\",\"decisionType\":\"spec-deviation-ruling\",\"question\":\"For Story 1, do you accept both declared deviations as satisfying story acceptance: (1) reload for no-flag/--resume reattaches to the cwd's most-recent registry thread instead of reconstructing from the prior resolved thread id, and (2) production --resume shows the cwd-scoped title/created/id list via ctx.ui.notify but auto-selects the most recent thread because PI v0.79.2 has no interactive selection surface?\",\"defaultRecommendation\":\"Do not accept the story unless both deviations are explicitly approved; if either is rejected, route back to implementation for that exact item.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/014-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/013-continue.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/stories/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution.md\"],\"allowedResponses\":[\"approve-both-deviations\",\"reject-reload-deviation\",\"reject-resume-picker-deviation\",\"reject-both-deviations\"]},\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"ask-ruling\"}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-009.md:251:| TC-2.3 | Session order from converter source-